hem  didn't include a picture and one of them  did so it turned out it but I went a bit  against the common consensus about  pictures because there was where 76  retweets on the one that didn't have a  picture and 64 on the one that did but  of course you can't just look at the  original experiment you need to look at  the following scholarly discourse in  this case we have a follow-up Robinson  2018 that pointed out that the original  did not use an appropriate normalization  metric and we should have normalized by  the number of followers it was followed  by a comment on Robinson 2018  along the lines of the fact that life  isn't fair and finally of course most  importantly we have peer review where  others that are involved in this space  are able to give their own opinion about  this discussion thank you  [Applause]  you
 

